# BUZZBOLT: wave 4's rot walls come down in rows; some blocks are gates
# that switch on and off. On, a block is solid (touching it is a loss) and
# can be shot down; off, it is harmless: shots and the ship pass through.
game buzzbolt
# the opening: A skips it
press A
press A
wait 10
press A
cheat quiet
wait 130
cheat gate 160 80 60
expect gates_on == 1
expect gates_off == 0
waituntil gates_off == 1 70
expect gates_on == 0
# off: shots go straight through it, and so does the ship
cheat pos 160 150
press A
wait 20
expect foe0_hp == 16
cheat pos 160 92
hold UP 12
expect py < 72
expect alive == 1
# on again: it can be shot...
waituntil gates_on == 1 70
cheat pos 160 150
press A
wait 10
expect foe0_hp < 16
# ...and touching it is a loss
wait 20
cheat gate 60 80 200
cheat pos 60 100
hold UP 20
expect alive == 0
# in the wave: rows come down, and the gate rows switch
cheat wave 4
cheat god
waituntil foes_10 > 0 400
waituntil gates_off > 0 600
expect gates_on > 0
